  "description": "Discontinued, superseded by the 27.5\" wheeled Soul Gen4. This page is kept as an archive record for owners and for anyone researching an original 26\" Cotic Soul.\n\nYears of production: 2003-2014 (Gen1 to Gen3, with Gen3 from 2012)\n\nThe Soul is where Cotic started. A trail riding machine in the truest sense, with amazing adaptability and all round performance, it was conceived as a modern steel hardtail and that is where we always aimed to keep it.\n\nTough, light, zippy, fun, interactive, durable, comfortable. It was happy ripping up the singletrack at your local woods or trail centre, crossing maps on bivvy adventures, smashing rocks in the Peak or Lake Districts, or tearing down mountains on summer holidays. It was the ultimate expression of the 26\" wheel hardtail.\n\nFinishes (final Gen3 frames): Matte Duckegg and Matte Gritstone. Earlier frames were also shown in Duckegg, Bright Green, orange and black.\nSizes: XS (14.5\"), Small (16\"), Medium (17.5\") and Large (19\").",
